  <div class="panel-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / REPO LIFECYCLE</span><h2 id="lifecycle-title">From bullion<br /><em>to credit.</em></h2></div><p>Gold is escrowed on the collateral chain, the pledge and the spot price are proved on Creditcoin, and only then does principal move. Default and margin calls are both permissionless.</p></div>
  <div class="workflow-grid"><article class="surface workflow-card"><span class="workflow-number">01</span><span class="eyebrow">COLLATERAL</span><h3>Proved pledges</h3><strong data-count="locked">—</strong><p>Allocated gold escrowed off-chain of Creditcoin, verified before any principal moves.</p><button class="quiet-button" data-refresh>Refresh state ↻</button></article><article class="surface workflow-card"><span class="workflow-number">02</span><span class="eyebrow">CREDIT</span><h3>Principal drawn</h3><strong data-count="funded">—</strong><p>Released only inside the advance rate, measured at the last proved Chainlink round.</p><button class="quiet-button" data-refresh>Refresh state ↻</button></article><article class="surface workflow-card violet-surface"><span class="workflow-number">03</span><span class="eyebrow">SETTLEMENT</span><h3>Released &amp; defaulted</h3><strong data-count="closed">—</strong><p>Closed on a proved release, or defaulted when maturity passes with repayment unproved.</p><button class="quiet-button" data-refresh>Refresh state ↻</button></article></div>
